      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Change MDCFG.t writing behavior\n\nCurrent implementation ignores the writing values higher or equal to\nENTRY_NUM. There is a bug that the last entry can not be covered. This\ncommit fixes the bug by changing the writing behavior that the model\naccepts writing value higher than ENTRY_NUM.",
