        "name": "Alvin Chang",
        "email": "alvinga@andestech.com",
        "date": "2026-01-29T04:30:23Z"
      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Skip entries which indexes >= HWCFG1.entry_num\n\nThe spec says:\nAny entry with index ≥ HWCFG1.entry_num is not available. That is,\n- Registers of the entry are not implemented.\n- Address mode of the entry is treated as OFF when the IOPMP retrieves\n  the entry in permission checks.\n\nThe reference model skips such entries during permission checks.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "f50dd22a371427afec8d6036862fb8994d50a1d8",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv-non-isa/riscv-iopmp/git/trees/f50dd22a371427afec8d6036862fb8994d50a1d8"
